WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.391
Unit twenty-two. Active Every Day!

2
00:00:04.361 --> 00:00:08.231
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.281 --> 00:00:11.339
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:14.995
Today we learn about Active Every Day. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.826 --> 00:00:20.459
Physical activity. Say it with me. Physical activity!

6
00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:28.291
60 minutes. Say it with me. 60 minutes!

7
00:00:31.805 --> 00:00:35.088
Heart. Say it with me. Heart!

8
00:00:38.578 --> 00:00:42.328
Muscles. Say it with me. Muscles!

9
00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:49.210
Sitting. Say it with me. Sitting!

10
00:00:52.712 --> 00:00:55.862
Play. Say it with me. Play!

11
00:00:59.346 --> 00:01:02.596
Sport. Say it with me. Sport!

12
00:01:06.113 --> 00:01:09.563
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

13
00:01:13.065 --> 00:01:22.328
Children need about 60 minutes of physical activity every day. Play and sport make the heart and muscles stronger. Too much sitting is not healthy, so I move often.

14
00:01:22.378 --> 00:01:23.550
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.991 --> 00:01:30.337
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.387 --> 00:01:31.537
Heart!

17
00:01:32.319 --> 00:01:37.588
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.638 --> 00:01:38.788
Sport!

19
00:01:39.606 --> 00:01:44.772
Did you know? Walking or cycling to school counts as physical activity!

20
00:01:44.822 --> 00:01:46.800
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.477 --> 00:01:55.470
Think and answer. How do you reach 60 active minutes in a day?

22
00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.670
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.775 --> 00:02:02.324
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.374 --> 00:02:05.025
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

